  "text": "Evidence on pain is mixed across conditions. A fibromyalgia review reported consistent short-term pain and quality of life improvements, though heterogeneity limited generalizability. In chronic trapezius myofascial pain, 808 nanometer laser was not superior to placebo for pain outcomes.",
